# Dependency Injection

## Registration Rules

| What | Annotation | Why |
|------|-----------|-----|
| Services, Repositories | `@LazySingleton(as: Interface)` | Stateless, one instance shared |
| Cubits / BLoCs | `@injectable` | Factory: fresh instance per route |
| Async third-party (SharedPreferences) | `@preResolve` in `@module` | Must be ready before app runs |

## Always Code Against Interfaces

```dart
// Good
@LazySingleton(as: AuthRepository)
class MockAuthRepository implements AuthRepository { ... }

// Bad - no interface
@lazySingleton
class AuthRepository { ... }
```

## Third-Party Module

```dart
@module
abstract class RegisterModule {
  @preResolve
  Future<SharedPreferences> get prefs => SharedPreferences.getInstance();

  @lazySingleton
  FlutterSecureStorage get secureStorage => const FlutterSecureStorage();
}
```

## Bootstrap

`main.dart` must await init: `await configureDependencies(environment: 'mock');`

## After Changes

Run `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs` to regenerate `injection.config.dart`.
